    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV -  This instantly appealing and inviting 3 bed semi detached SOUTH-FACING family home has been cleverly EXTENDED modernised and upgraded over the years with no expense spared. A Modern and contemporary property yet exceptionally homely, the property enjoys spacious, light-filled, well appointed  accommodation, which has been meticulously maintained, perfect for family living with the added benefit of NO ONWARD CHAIN. Conveniently located in a quiet cul de sac setting adjacent to a local green space ideal for young families. Located just in off the main Ballycullen  Road, in this highly sought after residential estate which enjoys every conceivable amenity and service literally on your doorstep, to include public transport. Viewing is highly advised in order to fully appreciate its size, location and suitability to family living.  Within a short stroll of Dodder Valley Park, the Shopping Centre, public transport, a selection of schools, sports clubs etc., The nearby M50 provides ease of access to various routes. An exceptional home sure to please all who view. Early viewing is highly advised to avoid disappointment. REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch with tiled flooring to the hallway 2.99m x 2.39m with wood flooring,\r\nLounge :4.79m x 3.48m  feature marble fireplace with wood surround, gas coal flame effect fire inset, wood flooring\r\n2nd reception room : 4.70m x 4.47m wood flooring, open plan to the dining area\r\nUtility room :  1.25m x 1.67m wall mounted Volkera gas boiler, plumbed for the washing machine, excellent storage\r\nShower room :  1.18m x 2.24m oversized shower cubicle - pedestal whb - wc - Fully tiled\r\nKitchen/Dining room :  3.81m x 5.70m Superb selection of Cream units and presses, tiled splash area, extractor hood, divider island and breakfast counter, wood flooring, French doors lead to the garden\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\nBathroom :  1.73m x 2.34m Shower bath with curved screen, pedestal whb - wc - Fully tiled\r\nBedroom 1 : 3.59m x 3.05m Corner built in wardrobes \r\nBedroom 2 :  3.26m x 4.60m wall to wall wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3 :  2.71m x 2.94m built in wardrobes, built in bed incorporating additional storage"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PVC double glazed windows throughout\r\nPVC fascia and soffit\r\nGas fired radiator central heating, Volkera boiler\r\nUtility room plus separate shower room downstairs\r\nFully tiled bathroom upstairs\r\nAll 3 bedrooms have modern built in wardrobes and wood flooring\r\nReplaced internal doors throughout \r\nAttic with pull down ladder\r\nWalled garden to the front, excellent side entrance\r\nWalled private garden to the rear, patio area perfect for relaxing or entertaining complete with shelter and privacy screen\r\nMetal style shed\r\nCul de sac setting with excellent on-street parking\r\nBER NO 107336208"
